# 第 9 轮 · 创新 ARC 题（多逻辑组合）

> 参考题（20 道）：48d8fb45, 57aa92db, 74dd1130, 54db823b, 6cf79266, 465b7d93, 99fa7670, c3202e5a, 53b68214, 662c240a, e76a88a6, f8b3ba0a, bf32578f, 36fdfd69, 1b60fb0c, b775ac94, bf45cf4b, 5c0a986e, 6f473927, a2fd1cf0
>
> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：crop, scaling, recolor, completion, mirror, erase, fill, stretch, ray_extend, draw_line, extract, translate, symmetry_detect, stamp_overlay, counting, sorting, symmetry_completion, rotate, pixel_upscale, tile, concatenate
> - 对象类：foreground_object, marker_pixel, sprite, template, indicator_region, square_canvas, foreground_rectangle, sparse_marker, blank_region, hollow_rectangle, isolated_pixel, canvas_boundary, separator_line, grid_cell, row_pattern, canvas, tile(obj), multicolor_template, solid_rectangle, monochrome_rect, color_frequency, half_outline, symmetry_axis, filled_rectangle, foreground_shape, square, start_marker, end_marker, control_sprite, polychrome_tile, indicator_pixel
> - 空间关系类：adjacency_contact, alignment_match, interior_marker_count, row_column_alignment, bbox_mapping, equal_partition, periodic_translation, stacked_layout, size_matching, frequency_ordering, symmetry, inside_bbox, rotational_symmetry, adjacency, mask_mapping, diagonal_dir, manhattan_path
> - 条件类：marker_selects_neighbor, indicator_scale_align, diag_transpose, least_marker_selected, black_to_foreground, connect_then_fill, turning_path_to_next_marker_row, unique_mono_cell, ignore_distractors, outlier_selection, period_shift_rows, select_asym_tile, same_size_replace, skip_most_frequent, fill_interior_spans, marker_bounded_rect_recolor, missing_marked_new_color, indicator_sets_axis_color, filled_pixel_expands_to_tile, color_diag_corner_edge, touching_border_determines_axis, negative_color_remap, L_path_connection
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

